Package: tiltback-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: tiltback (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell
Enhances: gnome-shell
Description: GNOME/Mutter HID rebind helper for TiltBack
 Enables tiltback-rebind.path so follow can reopen evdev after a
 udev calibration write. Pulled on GNOME the same way Alpine
 install_if pulls tiltback-gnome when gnome-shell is present.
